    {
      "document_id": "222",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The editorial attacks proposed federal gun-registration measures: the War Powers Act debate over registering/requisitioning arms, Attorney General Clark's registration proposal, and Rep. Carson's H.B. 1061 'to require the registration of all privately owned firearms.' Proposed registration legislation is at the core of the definition."
    },
    {
      "document_id": "223",
      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "A July 4 tribute to Revolutionary-era marksmanship and its role in independence. It is firearms history and marksmanship heritage with no discussion of firearm regulation."
    },
    {
      "document_id": "224",
